          "content built from assets, code or game files you do not have the right to use.",
        ] },
        "Cyrus scans generated and imported code and assets, and we may review prompts, builds, public listings and reports to keep people safe, enforce these terms, investigate abuse and improve safety. We can refuse a request, stop a build, remove or hide content, withhold output, suspend access and report unlawful activity to the authorities. We do not call a scanned build \"safe\"; a scan lowers risk but does not remove it.",
