        "You give Nxeon a worldwide, non-exclusive licence to host, store, copy, process, run, scan, display and transmit Your Input and Output as needed to provide Cyrus to you, keep it secure, prevent abuse, and show it where you choose to publish it. This licence ends when your content is deleted, except for backups and records described in the Privacy Policy and anything you published that others have already received.",
