      ],
    },
    {
      heading: "International transfers",
      blocks: [
        "Cyrus and its providers process data in several countries, which may differ from where you live. Where the law requires safeguards for such transfers we rely on appropriate mechanisms such as standard contractual clauses with our providers.",
      ],
    },
    {
      heading: "Cookies and analytics",
      blocks: [
        "On cyrus.my we use strictly necessary storage: a secure session cookie that keeps you signed in, short-lived sign-in state cookies used during the Nxeon sign-in handoff, and a cookie that remembers your cookie choice (kept for 180 days).",
        "Optional cookies or storage are only set if you accept them in the cookie banner. \"Analytics\" allows capture of the referral code and campaign tags (UTM) of the link you arrived from, kept for up to 30 days. \"Marketing\" additionally allows ad click identifiers (such as fbclid and gclid). If you consent, a record of that consent and of the attribution is saved with your account at sign-up, and may be used to report a sign-up or purchase conversion to the advertising platform; the report carries a one-way hash of your email and no raw personal data. \"Reject all\" is as easy as \"Accept all\", nothing optional is stored before you choose, and your choice does not affect your access to Cyrus.",
